{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t在立法會大會上，有議員關注多個工程建築項目接連被揭發出現問題。發展局局長甯漢豪表示，已增加抽查次數，又指會善用科技。<br/>\n<br/>\n另外，甯漢豪表示，港鐵東涌延綫東涌西站被揭發月台層部分支柱石屎懷疑未有灌到頂的事件，正反映監察及抽查機制發揮作用。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.491761+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:51:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:24.081072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:07:00.542174+00:00","content_hash":"25d6b7036073ef79fd174bbd3373864eba0999fd89a4aee04e945e37ddf90961","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}